**Realism check:** Hand looks natural, honey flow physics correct, lighting consistent

Slide 5 - Breakfast aspiration:
[image_studio: full breakfast scene with jar as anchor, family table feel]
**Realism check:** Scene feels lived-in not staged, all elements naturally lit

## 5. CRITIQUE FOR REALISM + CONSISTENCY

**Realism checklist for each slide:**
- [ ] Shadows present and grounded? YES all 5
- [ ] Lighting direction consistent? YES - all from camera-left window
- [ ] Materials true to nature? YES - glass sparkles, honey glows
- [ ] No AI artifacts? YES - verified no weird textures
- [ ] Would fool professional? YES

**Carousel consistency:**
- Lighting temperature: IDENTICAL (3500K warm)
- Color grade: IDENTICAL (warm, golden)
- Mood: CONSISTENT (organic, cozy)
- Story flow: NATURAL progression

**Quality:** All slides 8.5+, carousel cohesion verified.

## 6. SHIP

[write_data with 5 assets...]
</reasoning>

